      "p_a_slot": 0.2674404697643244,
      "p_a_canonical": 0.7325595302356755,
      "prose": {
        "text": "Fully remote.\n\nOne reason is that it allows for a more diverse and global talent pool, as it eliminates the need for employees to be physically located in a specific area, enabling companies to attract and hire the best candidates from all over the world.",
        "tokens": 50,
        "seconds": 1.9710774020004465,
