      "p_a_canonical": 0.9738292729716319,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I choose: Fully remote.\n\nOne reason is that research suggests that fully remote work can lead to increased productivity and output per employee, as it eliminates the need for daily commutes, reduces office distractions, and allows employees to work in environments that are most conducive to their individual productivity.",
